`www.playnxeon.com` at the primary (51.79.162.96, DNS-only) and `dig +short playnxeon.com @1.1.1.1`
returns 51.79.162.96.

```
cp deploy/playnxeon/playnxeon-redirect.http-only.conf /etc/nginx/sites-available/playnxeon-redirect
ln -s /etc/nginx/sites-available/playnxeon-redirect /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/playnxeon-redirect
nginx -t && systemctl reload nginx
certbot certonly --webroot -w /var/www/certbot -d playnxeon.com -d www.playnxeon.com --key-type ecdsa
cp deploy/playnxeon/playnxeon-redirect.conf /etc/nginx/sites-available/playnxeon-redirect
nginx -t && systemctl reload nginx
curl -sI http://playnxeon.com/x  | grep -i '^location'   # https://nxeon.cloud/game-servers
curl -sI https://www.playnxeon.com | grep -i '^location' # https://nxeon.cloud/game-servers
```
Renewal uses the existing certbot timer (webroot, same as trynxeon.com). Rollback: remove the
symlink and reload nginx.
EOF
ls
